docs {
Riwayat ping keep-alive Supabase. Cursor-based, terbaru dulu. Hanya admin/root.
Baris ditulis workflow Supabase Keep-Alive (repo api) via DATABASE_URL - API hanya baca.
Query opsional: env=staging|production, limit=1..100, cursor.
Status: ok | failed. http_status = kode HTTP /auth/v1/health saat ping.

200:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "01J…",
          "created_at": "2026-10-05T02:00:05.000Z",
          "project_label": "sambasku-staging",
          "project_ref": "wkhlcrxlncflcztptrmg",
          "env": "staging",
          "http_status": 200,
          "status": "ok",
          "duration_ms": 412,
          "github_run_url": "https://github.com/sambasku/api/actions/runs/…",
          "error_message": null
        }
      ],
      "meta": { "limit": 20, "next_cursor": null, "has_more": false }
    }
}

meta {
  name: List Supabase Health Checks
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/system/supabase/health-checks?limit=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

tests {
  test("status 200 + envelope list + meta cursor", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data).to.be.an('array');
    expect(res.body.meta).to.have.property('has_more');
    expect(res.body.meta.limit).to.equal(20);
  });
}
